{
  "data": {
    "about": "Blood type: B\n\nBirthplace: Seki, Gifu Prefecture, Japan\n\nBirth name: Risa Oribe (織部 里沙)\n\nLiSA is a Japanese singer, who sings as Yui—the vocalist of the fictional group, Girls Dead Monster, in the anime Angel Beats!\n\nBorn in Gifu prefecture, LiSA started her own band while in high school to catch a growing wave of punk rock. In 2008, she moved to Tokyo in order to further her musical career.\n\nThe name \"LiSA\" stands for: Love is Same All or LiVE is Smile Always\n\nMarried to voice actor Tatsuhisa Suzuki.\n\nTwitter: @LiSA_OLiVE\n\nInstagram: xlisa_olivex\n\nBlog: http://ameblo.jp/lxixsxa/\n\nFacebook: lxixsxa.jp",
    "alternate_names": [
      "織部里沙",
      "Risa Oribe"
    ],
